stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNINITIALIZED: system start
    UNINITIALIZED --> WAITING_MODEL: ensureLLM() → spawnLlama()
    
    WAITING_MODEL --> MODEL_READY: stdout shows "> " or "Enter no prompt"
    WAITING_MODEL --> MODEL_ERROR: spawn error
    MODEL_ERROR --> SCHEDULE_RESTART: llmBus.emit("error", err)

    MODEL_READY --> IDLE_PROCESSING: llmBus.emit("ready")\nrestartCount=0, restartDelay=1000
    IDLE_PROCESSING --> PROCESSING_REQUEST: processQueue() → write stdin
    
    PROCESSING_REQUEST --> READING_RESPONSE: waiting for stdout
    READING_RESPONSE --> CRASH_DETECTED: process "close" with non-zero code
    READING_RESPONSE --> RESPONSE_COMPLETE: "\n> $" pattern detected
    RESPONSE_COMPLETE --> IDLE_PROCESSING: done → processQueue() next

    CRASH_DETECTED --> EMIT_CRASH: llmBus.emit("crash", code)
    EMIT_CRASH --> INCREMENT_RESTART: restartCount++
    
    INCREMENT_RESTART --> CHECK_MAX_RESTARTS: restartCount > MAX_RESTARTS (5)?
    CHECK_MAX_RESTARTS --> EXIT_ABORT: YES → process.exit(1)
    CHECK_MAX_RESTARTS --> APPLY_BACKOFF: NO → delay = restartDelay

    APPLY_BACKOFF --> DOUBLE_DELAY: restartDelay = min(delay*2, 30000)
    DOUBLE_DELAY --> WAIT_DELAY: setTimeout(delay)
    WAIT_DELAY --> SPAWN_AGAIN: spawnLlama()

    SPAWN_AGAIN --> WAITING_MODEL: try again

    state "Exponential Backoff" as BACKOFF {
        1: "1s"
        2: "2s"
        3: "4s"
        4: "8s"
        5: "16s"
    }

    note right of CHECK_MAX_RESTARTS: Séquence de backoff:\n1s → 2s → 4s → 8s → 16s\n(max 30s, max 5 tentatives)
    note right of EXIT_ABORT: Abandon total du processus\naprès 5 échecs consécutifs
    note right of CRASH_DETECTED: Causes possibles:\n- OOM (Out Of Memory)\n- Segfault\n- Model incompatibilité\n- Disk I/O error
